    "Loop Finished Broadcasts": {},
    "Most stations stream continuously and never end, so this changes nothing for them. A station that broadcasts a fixed-length programme — an hourly newscast, say — stops when it reaches the end; turn this on to have it start over instead.": {},
    "Playback": {},
